    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you like pina coladas? Want to escape to a sunny beach getaway packed with hot alien babes? Sunwave Hotel is an erotic visual novel with point-and-click adventure elements that blends science-fiction fantasy with high-octane thrills and sexual escapades! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Following a heist gone wrong, you and your partner-in-crime have crash landed on a tropical paradise. However this is no time for a vacation- your employer is a ruthless criminal overlord and expects results. You must find a way to get back on your feet and carry out your original job or face the consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010210/extras/8fb571f67344972fd227bd8d790166dc.avif?t=1751366989\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chart your course across a chain of exotic islands- making new friends and contending with new dangers along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CHOOSE YOUR PATH -</strong> With multiple routes across the islands, you have many options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BLOW OFF STEAM -</strong> Dozens of sex scenes, beautifully rendered with hand-drawn artwork.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MAKE IT COUNT -</strong> Do you complete your original mission, or join up with your new friends?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010210/extras/2d7b08ecef2d0e6ec1119027ce037354.avif?t=1751366989\" /></div></p>",
